    ### What this PR does / why we need it?
    
    Migrate the Kimi-K3 deployment guide and support matrix entries from
    `docs/kimi-k3-v0.27.1` to `main`. Mark Kimi-K3 as supported and remove
    experimental labels and the experimental-support warning. Preserve the
    existing PD reference-design and MindIE Motor production note.
    
