    Products, A3, A2. Explain the model weight directories and consistently
    use `<YOUR_MODEL_PATH>` and `<YOUR_DRAFT_MODEL_PATH>` placeholders. Keep
    the existing Docker commands and verification instructions.
    
    Related to #18520. Main-branch counterpart of #18463.
    
